// Retired. Was /api/interest-availability, replaced by /api/interest-suggestions
// (see _lib/interestSuggestions.ts). For a while it stayed on as a stub that
// returned 410, because the environment it was deprecated in could not delete
// files.
//
// Moved out of api/ on 4 Sep 2026 because a stub is not free: Vercel's Hobby
// plan builds at most 12 Serverless Functions per deployment, one per file in
// api/, and this was holding a slot. Adding api/capacity.ts made it 13 and the
// deploy failed after a clean build, at "Deploying outputs" with no compiler
// error, which is a confusing way to learn about a quota.
//
// Anything under api/_lib is library code, not a route, so nothing here is
// built as a function. Kept as .bak rather than deleted only because file
// deletion still isn't available here; git history is the real record.
//
// If you need a 13th route, merge two rather than adding one.
export default async function handler(req, res) {
  res.status(410).json({ error: 'This endpoint has been replaced by /api/interest-suggestions.' });
}
